    "body": "The layout of the documentation is a bit weird:\r\n\r\n- we need a landing page\r\n- API Reference is not an illustrative name and it subsumes many things that are not really connected ->\r\n- [x] Top Level: User Guide -> QNNs, Quantum Kernel Methods, Executor, Operators for expectation values, Quantum Feature Maps, (Projected Quanum Kernel)\r\n- [x] New Hirarchy top level -> lower level: QML Regressors, QML Classifiers, Circuit Design -> Operators, Feature Maps -> Tools for Feature maps, (?unclear?) Low-Level -> Base Classes, Quantum Kernel, QNN",
